rop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=2ac83bbe4d3fa64458389e9ef848ecd1", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/226ea16c/uploads/origins/1c7ebbe5-f56e-4c99-ab03-e89502c06678?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=2ac83bbe4d3fa64458389e9ef848ecd1, https://si.imgix.net/226ea16c/uploads/origins/1c7ebbe5-f56e-4c99-ab03-e89502c06678?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=e3de17206b6f3b9a41ebe832281b05df 2x, https://si.imgix.net/226ea16c/uploads/origins/1c7ebbe5-f56e-4c99-ab03-e89502c06678?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=78d79a4cba369b2e64996d638fd2caff 3x"}, "body": "I would like a commission of two vTubers, my friend (Milo) and I (Oniigan). This piece is very special to me as my friend (Milo), passed away last year. \n\nOniigan, the panda girl, does not have an official color palette, so color her however you want! Milo, is a femboy and he is my best friend, we would go everywhere together holding hands. \n\nCould I please get the piece as a high quality 300dpi file? I would like to print and frame this piece for myself.\n\nThank you!\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1RGzXaR_vNV3GnDoV0G6cCgA8BriFkmwM", "nc": 16, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@How_much_gohan/works/4", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 2629190, "client_id": 2227352, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/9fa4831f/uploads/origins/eb9060db-502e-4c2e-90ba-3cae53db4fe5?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=63c84e15f0f0d46dacfbbb8bdcdded72", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/9fa4831f/uploads/origins/eb9060db-502e-4c2e-90ba-3cae53db4fe5?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=63c84e15f0f0d46dacfbbb8bdcdded72, https://si.imgix.net/9fa4831f/uploads/origins/eb9060db-502e-4c2e-90ba-3cae53db4fe5?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=7815b929c188f851785017d3df1f3e80 2x, https://si.imgix.net/9fa4831f/uploads/origins/eb9060db-502e-4c2e-90ba-3cae53db4fe5?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d0fe65edf42f23ba17c79d6fa4dc516f 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/9fa4831f/uploads/origins/eb9060db-502e-4c2e-90ba-3cae53db4fe5?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=c3b25583d1fdc7fe627200d7bb422f14", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/9fa4831f/uploads/origins/eb9060db-502e-4c2e-90ba-3cae53db4fe5?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=c3b25583d1fdc7fe627200d7bb422f14, https://si.imgix.net/9fa4831f/uploads/origins/eb9060db-502e-4c2e-90ba-3cae53db4fe5?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=50dbdba643bf99982c421ecdabb5f80f 2x, https://si.imgix.net/9fa4831f/uploads/origins/eb9060db-502e-4c2e-90ba-3cae53db4fe5?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=439e633e1a88dbd3819adb058d0cecce 3x"}, "body": "こんにちは。よいかわです。\nMi~raさんの色彩豊かなもちもちしたイラストが大好きです。\n今回は私のOCを描いていただきたいです。\n\nリクエスト内容\nSDイラスト\n表情や状況などはお任せ\n料金の範囲で背景を描写できるのであればお願いします。\n\n使用用途\n個人観賞、アクスタにして飾りたいと考えています\n\n形式\nPSDがあると嬉しいです。\n背景があれば、背景とキャラクターを分けて納品いただけると幸いです。\nグッズにしたいので、サイズは2000×2000pxほどを希望します。上下しても構いません。\nキャンバス比率はお任せです。\n\nキャラクター詳細\nメリーゴーランドのユニコーンの擬人化のホルンです。\n廃園した遊園地にいるキャラクターで、お客さんが来ないことを悲しんでいる現実の姿とお客でにぎわった時代に馳せる夢の世界の姿があります。\n三面図がなくて申し訳ないですが、わかる範囲で描写していただく形で大丈夫です。\n服装はアレンジ、変更して構いません。\n設定もあまり気にしなくても大丈夫です。\n耳としっぽは描写上ない方がいい場合はなくても構いません。\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1lfDqS-Dq5nvhWOYZ_dDmihYf3hgYSfvH?usp=sharing\n\n以上です。よろしくお願いします。\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1lfDqS-Dq5nvhWOYZ_dDmihYf3hgYSfvH?usp=sharing", "nc": 129, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@How_much_gohan/works/3", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 2629190, "client_id": 513034, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/a713a20c/uploads/origins/4d829720-4aa9-4d1d-8bac-e44362e22f36?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=5e3be81e71309c6c26c775a4619acee7", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/a713a20c/uploads/origins/4d829720-4aa9-4d1d-8bac-e44362e22f36?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=5e3be81e71309c6c26c775a4619acee7, https://si.imgix.net/a713a20c/uploads/origins/4d829720-4aa9-4d1d-8bac-e44362e22f36?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f7019fca539dd8d259c66d208518be38 2x, https://si.imgix.net/a713a20c/uploads/origins/4d829720-4aa9-4d1d-8bac-e44362e22f36?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=5f23fab2497b3a8f2e1f9e4ad120e431 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/a713a20c/uploads/origins/4d829720-4aa9-4d1d-8bac-e44362e22f36?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=5565a2fb3b4a5e3e8e7e4415e5169a3f", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/a713a20c/uploads/origins/4d829720-4aa9-4d1d-8bac-e44362e22f36?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=5565a2fb3b4a5e3e8e7e4415e5169a3f, https://si.imgix.net/a713a20c/uploads/origins/4d829720-4aa9-4d1d-8bac-e44362e22f36?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=12feb4f89c0db2dde87387df96172451 2x, https://si.imgix.net/a713a20c/uploads/origins/4d829720-4aa9-4d1d-8bac-e44362e22f36?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=0786f5e7d379d20e9f9913480b49a044 3x"}, "body": "Hi Mira! & thank you for your hard work!\n\nI would like to ask Mira-san to draw my three OC artists as soon as possible!\n\nI would like to see Patrienne, a bright painter, Litelina, a taciturn literary girl, and Silver Symphony, a mature musician, in your drawing! You may add your own arrangement.\n\nPoses are free. Since they are artists, we would be more than happy if you could add some western elements (western decorations, items, etc.) in addition to the characters.\n\nThis is my second request, and I look forward to working with you!\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/u/3/folders/1LPhG0f9h1H0QZI4StEOMwzsQ_WL89BtK", "nc": 145, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@How_much_gohan/works/2", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 2629190, "client_id": 1630619, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/4829df69/uploads/origins/4a3d6f7d-b916-49e4-b85a-ac7b3d169bd8?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=decf680b395cf1d301a1063ae7b1b075", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/4829df69/uploads/origins/4a3d6f7d-b916-49e4-b85a-ac7b3d169bd8?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=decf680b395cf1d301a1063ae7b1b075, https://si.imgix.net/4829df69/uploads/origins/4a3d6f7d-b916-49e4-b85a-ac7b3d169bd8?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=4d1a675ecc10db3eba96264ff1946658 2x, https://si.imgix.net/4829df69/uploads/origins/4a3d6f7d-b916-49e4-b85a-ac7b3d169bd8?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b92e3131252a2e1f7ff668fee7617448 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/4829df69/uploads/origins/4a3d6f7d-b916-49e4-b85a-ac7b3d169bd8?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=cdac1808e17aeed3f23d7fe58a77365a", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/4829df69/uploads/origins/4a3d6f7d-b916-49e4-b85a-ac7b3d169bd8?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=cdac1808e17aeed3f23d7fe58a77365a, https://si.imgix.net/4829df69/uploads/origins/4a3d6f7d-b916-49e4-b85a-ac7b3d169bd8?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=1cec573d05df1541a09e5ad9d66f69ba 2x, https://si.imgix.net/4829df69/uploads/origins/4a3d6f7d-b916-49e4-b85a-ac7b3d169bd8?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=d97db3b3fad7d422926fb10c8a0fbf19 3x"}, "body": "Hello!! I saw your art recently and I absolutely love your style!! I like the way you draw humanoid characters, so I hope it's OK to request my OCs! They are all sea creatures!\n\nI hope it's OK to request at least two characters, but please draw as many as you as you like! The red girl is a vampire squid who is bratty and punkish! The blue boy is a ghost shark that eats a lot and is very friendly! The pink girl is an axolotl smokes a lot and is a bit mean! They are all best friends! Please feel free to mix and match!\n\nPlease have fun with this request if accepted! I want you to enjoy drawing them, and I leave pose, background, and composition up to you! Thank you for your consideration! Please keep up the amazing work!\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1eIq7cq74cpgKPExD22_W9t4UryP-R0jq?usp=sharing", "nc": 1, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@How_much_gohan/works/1", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 2629190, "client_id": 513034, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/60bf58bb/uploads/origins/26d6d2a9-2296-41ab-ab9f-ddb5f4fc784a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f82007bd2ac7faa113594185e2ebee10", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/60bf58bb/uploads/origins/26d6d2a9-2296-41ab-ab9f-ddb5f4fc784a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f82007bd2ac7faa113594185e2ebee10, https://si.imgix.net/60bf58bb/uploads/origins/26d6d2a9-2296-41ab-ab9f-ddb5f4fc784a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=fdf6d4771091834dd1c9f157b94c1fba 2x, https://si.imgix.net/60bf58bb/uploads/origins/26d6d2a9-2296-41ab-ab9f-ddb5f4fc784a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=1ea516775e958b436ad3a60ffab03d1c 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/60bf58bb/uploads/origins/26d6d2a9-2296-41ab-ab9f-ddb5f4fc784a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=ecb05700165a6843747cb2b4b277c587", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/60bf58bb/uploads/origins/26d6d2a9-2296-41ab-ab9f-ddb5f4fc784a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=ecb05700165a6843747cb2b4b277c587, https://si.imgix.net/60bf58bb/uploads/origins/26d6d2a9-2296-41ab-ab9f-ddb5f4fc784a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=5da96a422cb52589abff13858ca700b0 2x, https://si.imgix.net/60bf58bb/uploads/origins/26d6d2a9-2296-41ab-ab9f-ddb5f4fc784a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=1175359fad21c7288d1df84822f0d7b2 3x"}, "body": "みらさんこんにちは！\n いつもお世話になってます！  \n\n早速なのですがみらさんに私のOCであるルアナとバブルジョイを描いていただきたいです！ \nルアナはフラダンスが踊れたりウクレレ弾けたりするフラガールで、バブルジョイはとにかくシャボン玉を作っちゃうおてんば娘です。  \n\nポーズは自由。海、ビーチをイメージしていただけると幸いです。みらさんなりのアレンジを加えても構いません。あなたの絵柄で見てみたいです！ \n\n よろしくお願いします！\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/188U4mCkMGyeGn3jKl9Auq-WFiTUf-yyx", "nc": 1, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}], "sent_works": [], "similar_creators": [{"id": 527419, "creator": t